        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-754, Ribbon and Reed Flower Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis RK International Hardware made cabinet knob is fashioned in the traditional French Colonial style. The ribbon and reed design is well known and will be sure to add a bit of old world charm to your home. The Ribbon and Reed with Floral Center Cabinet Knob is available in antique english, distressed copper, oil rubbed bronze, satin nickel, and distressed nickel finishes. Available in a 1-1/4 inch diameter and a larger 1-1/2 inch diameter.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUse with matching <a href=\"/products/ribbon-and-reed-cabinet-knob-rose-rk-international-bp-484\"><b>BP-484 Ribbon and Reed Cabinet Knob Rose</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-754 Small Crosses and Petal Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-754:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-753:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-13/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR25_size.gif?v=1704354575\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
